    "description": {
      "value": "Each bloodline robe has a design that befits a particular sorcerer bloodline, depicting creatures of that bloodline or using styles common among them. You gain a +2 item bonus to each of your bloodline skills.\n\nActivate (1 Action)\nFrequency: once per day\nRequirements: You're benefiting from your blood magic effect\nYou're quickened on your next turn.\n\nYou can use the extra action only as part of Casting a bloodline spell.\n\nActivate (Free Action)\nFrequency: once per day\nYou gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a sorcerer bloodline spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost."
